  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An object is placed on the principal axis of convex lens of focal length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> as shown. A plane mirror is placed on the other side of lens at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. The image produced by the plane mirror is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> inside the mirror. The distance of the object from the lens is ____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cm</mi></math>.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/15f873a5-081b-457d-84d4-0594c357dfcd-9894770.PNG\" style=\"width: 228px; height: 160px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "30",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a602dd3b-e6cd-486c-a0f1-5b8ab6f42b4a-9894770_1.PNG\" style=\"width: 337px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>Given here: Focal length of convex lens,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>Now, as seen in figure, image from lens is formed at point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, whose location is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;from mirror. Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;from lens.</p><p>Using lens equation, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Putting the value,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, object is placed at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>&nbsp;from lens.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
